# Story: a floating calculator lives on the Desktop. It leaves with the
# Desktop when the camera zooms onto a docked window and comes back where it
# was. A minimized window gives its space away and gets it back.
# Reference: T03 T07 T52.
open Safari
open Notes
open Calculator 300x400
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
expect floating 103
expect visible 103
zoom 101
expect hidden 103
back
expect visible 103
minimize 102
expect visible 101
restore 102
expect visible 102
expect left-of 101 102
close 101
expect count docked 1
expect visible 102
